WEBVTT

00:44:29.064 --> 00:44:32.894
but I live in New York and DC, and so
I spend a lot of time in liberal circles.

00:44:32.918 --> 00:44:35.655
I would say I've heard more
condescending racial language

00:44:35.679 --> 00:44:38.275
in my progressive circles
than my conservative circles.

00:44:38.299 --> 00:44:41.621
CA: Like what? People talk about
white supremacist casually without --

00:44:41.645 --> 00:44:44.629
DB: No, not even that,
but just sort of patronizing attitudes

00:44:44.653 --> 00:44:46.810
towards African Americans
and other minorities

00:44:46.834 --> 00:44:49.453
and sort of "the bigotry
of low expectations,"

00:44:49.477 --> 00:44:50.875
as George W. Bush called it.

00:44:50.899 --> 00:44:54.432
And I think, for a lot of us,
at least on my kind of conservatism,

00:44:54.456 --> 00:44:57.919
Trump's appeals to race
were unsupportable.

00:44:57.943 --> 00:45:00.143
That was just -- no matter
what else he said,